Mid layer, cross-package: the transaction body. input()'s Get errors wrapped "source: %w" / "destination: %w",
rule violations behind (*Violation).Unwrap, Debit/Credit errors ("debit %s: %w", "credit %s: %w", bare
InsufficientFundsError), memory.Append's ErrDuplicate behind "transfer %d: %w", filerepo.Append's joined file
errors, Put errors behind "save %s: %w".
Expect all of those; NotFoundError[AccountID] only behind source/destination wraps. -fanout=2 keeps it compact.
-- args --
-fanout=2 service/service.go:@execute
